# Auto Git Push

After completing any code changes for this project:

1. **Always commit and push** without waiting for the user to ask.
2. Use author env vars if git identity is unset: `cheng19988` / `qiuxui646@gmail.com`.
3. Push to `https://github.com/cheng19988/phonesfarmbox.com.git` on `main` only.
4. Bypass local proxy on push: `git -c http.proxy= -c https.proxy= push origin main`
5. **On network timeout or failure**, retry push up to 3 times with a short delay before reporting failure.
6. Do not force-push. Do not commit `.env` or secrets.
